      "message": "Is this actually based on https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/docs/+/23870 with the addition of using linux audit subsystem as the backend to write the log events? (Or maybe reference the merged design instead: https://github.com/openbmc/docs/blob/master/designs/phosphor-audit.md)",
