      "writtenOn": "2026-09-10T21:14:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m wondering about the vision of this configuration file. Would there be a single one for every service that wants to use the audit mechanism? Would every unique audit point need a command entry in the Allowlist in order to be logged? How will this scale for multiple services with multiple services and multiple audit entries?\n\n\nI\u0027m also wondering about the structure of the \"Allowlist\". Looks like it is service dependent? Can it be standardized? (I.e. define an event that is not necessarily tied to a particular service. Then include the event on the Allowlist for desired services, or more generally a global Allowlist for an event from any service?)",
